      "Language": "bul",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A review of the literature is made on the complicated course of infectious and parasitic diseases, in which acute surgical abdomen syndrome develops. Surgical treatment of complicated infectious and parasitic diseases is a complex endeavour both from surgical and epidemiologic aspect. The high mortality rate after operations in complicated forms is associated with tactical errors in the surgical treatment and erroneously estimated extent of the surgical intervention."},
